    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I hear you, but I'm worried that if we spend too much time highlighting the limitations, we're just giving them an easy reason to reject it. We really need this to land to secure the next round of funding. Is there a way we can frame the sample size so it looks more like a deliberate choice—maybe as part of a high-depth pilot—rather than just a weakness?",
