      "content": "You can strategically reframe the small $n$ by emphasizing the **depth and qualitative richness** of the data gathered. Instead of just being a \"pilot,\" present it as focused, in-depth case studies designed to generate strong, nuanced preliminary findings. This framing suggests the goal was not statistical power but deep insight, positioning $n=12$ as highly purposeful for the current stage of the research.",
